 "business": {
  "text": "218 We are a specialized manufacturer and trader of rebonded polyurethane (PU) foam, operating a circular-economy business model that converts PU foam trims and off-cuts into value-added rebonded foam products. We are the largest rebonded Polyurethane (PU) Foam player in India (with an estimated market share of around 33% (FY 2026) and also the largest exporter of rebonded PU foam products in India.",
